  triage:title "render_task_event_line/render_prompt_handoff_line wrap infallible writes in Result/?" ;
  triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent (RBP-F002) via BB6-QA-L3-1789269000 (PR #1462, feature/bb6-cli-prompt-handoffs @ 40ccd403e), verdict PASS 0/4/2, 2026-09-13T00:38:04Z. task.rs's render_task_event_line (line 827) and render_prompt_handoff_line (line 856) wrap infallible String writes in a Result<()> return with `?` propagation, a fake-fallible signature. Ruled genuine by fenix (PR #1462 comment, 2026-09-13T00:38:04Z)." ;
