  triage:deferredNote "Fix: change render_task_event_line and render_prompt_handoff_line (task.rs:827, 856) to plain infallible signatures, dropping the fake Result<()>/? wrapping. Routed to solar on BB6-FIX-CLI-QA1-1789270000, branch fix/bb6-cli-qa1 cut from 4b0f6661c. Fixed by solar, pushed to fix/bb6-cli-qa1 @ 8fc3b9ef2 (2026-09-13T00:41:48Z, self-reported); solar's remaining four assigned findings (BB6-005, BB6-006, BB6-007, BB6-010) are still in progress on the same branch. Fixed-pending-QA. BB6-FIX-CLI-QA1-1789270000 complete and self-validated by solar (2026-09-13T01:10:38Z) at fix/bb6-cli-qa1 final head adda7e3f9, parent 3aa1954e8 (BB6 L4 final); closing-triage tasklist confirms implementation commit 8fc3b9ef2. Fixed-pending-QA at adda7e3f9." ;
